SUMMARY:The Foolbright Scholars' Play Lab with Angie Foster
DESCRIPTION:How can we liberate ourselves from the "shoulds" and "should no
 ts" that can constrain our natural capacity to be authentic\, playful and 
 creative? We'll explore through movement\, games\, and improvisation\, and
  use the clown's ability to take risks and put logic aside to make way for
  the imagination. What is important is not "getting it right" but rather f
 inding the magic of being surprised by what reveals itself when all else f
 alls away. No experience required\, only a willingness to play. We encoura
